"P596624709" "My sources have been reporting a strange trend in the latest round of Vahzilok kidnappings. It seems they're targeting particular individuals! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to hit the streets and defeat as many Vahzilok as you can find.</a> Maybe we can figure out who they're targeting, and why."
